e silently discards unedited category data\", \"actual\": \"Delete works (confirm dialog removes the row) and edits to description/amount/category/tax status are applied. But the edit dialog does not preload the transaction's category: editing only the amount (250 → 275) saved the record with a blank category, so the resulting record does not faithfully reflect only the user's change.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created expense category \\\"QA Test Category\\\" (violet); edited it to name \\\"QA Category Renamed\\\", color Amber, type Income (moved to Income group, amber shown selected on reopen); deleted it via confirm dialog and it disappeared from the list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Assigned category not retained/prefilled when editing\", \"actual\": \"Category options do correctly match the type (Income → Sales Revenue/Consulting/Interest Income/Other Income; Expense → the 8 expense categories). However, opening Edit on the Consulting income transaction shows Category = \\\"Select category\\\" instead of Consulting; saving after changing only the amount wiped the category — the row now reads [\\\"Aug 10, 2026\\\",\\\"QA Consulting Income Alpha\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"QA-INC-001\\\",\\\"+$275.00\\\",\\\"✓\\\"] with a blank category.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created transaction with Tax Related ON → TAX column showed ✓. Edited the same transaction toggling Tax Related OFF → TAX column now blank.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search \\\"Retainer\\\" + Type=Income + Category=Consulting + 2024-11-01..2024-12-05 yielded only \\\"Client Retainer Fee\\\" (Nov 15, 2024, Consulting, income) which satisfies all criteria; Clear Filters restored all 20 transactions with totals +$47,842.50 / -$36,585.99.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting the Add Transaction form with empty description and amount did not create a transaction; both fields are required and report validationMessage \\\"Please fill out this field.\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Invalid date range not rejected or explained\", \"actual\": \"Setting From=2024-12-31 and To=2024-01-01 was accepted silently; the table simply shows \\\"No transactions found / Try adjusting your filters\\\" with no message that the start date is after the end date.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing category not validated\", \"actual\": \"With description \\\"CS23 No Category Test\\\" and amount 12.34 but no category selected, the form submitted successfully with no error message. The new row appears in the table with an empty category cell: [\\\"Aug 28, 2026\\\",\\\"CS23 No Category Test\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"—\\\",\\\"-$12.34\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"\\\"].\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-24\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Deleting an in-use category orphans transactions\", \"actual\": \"Deleting the \\\"Utilities\\\" category (1 transaction, $285) was allowed with only a generic confirm (\\\"Transactions using this category will not be deleted\\\") and no reassignment option. The \\\"Electric Bill\\\" transaction now shows a blank category: [\\\"Dec 5, 2024\\\",\\\"Electric Bill\\\",\\\"\\\",\\\"—\\\",\\\"-$285.00\\\",\\\"✓\\\"].\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Total Balance summary never updates\", \"actual\": \"Monthly income/expenses/profit, the monthly report and Recent Transactions do update immediately on add/edit/delete (e.g. add +$250 income & -$100 expense → income $250, expenses $100, profit $150; edit to $275 and delete the expense → income $275, expenses $0, profit $275). However the dashboard \\\"Total Balance\\\" card stayed at $74,931 through every add, edit and delete, including after adding a $100,000 expense — it is static and ignores transactions.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Unmarking the $250 income tx removed it from the 2026 tax summary (income $250/1 tx → $0.00/0 transactions). Marking the $100 Marketing expense tax-related made 2026 show Deductible Expenses $100.00, Net -$100.00, Marketing 100%, 1 transaction listed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After adding/editing QA transactions, Categories shows Consulting \\\"4 transactions / $11,075\\\" (was 3 / $10,800, +$275 edit) and Marketing \\\"2 transactions / $950\\\" (was 1 / $850, +$100 new expense).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Print Report for year 2024 invoked window.print() once (instrumented), produced no console/page errors, and the page remained rendered.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Table columns: DATE, DESCRIPTION, CATEGORY, REFERENCE, AMOUNT, TAX, ACTIONS. Totals footer reflects the current result set (e.g. filtered to 2 rent rows: Total Income +$0.00, Total Expenses -$4,400.00).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Aug 2026 has only the two QA transactions (+$250 income, -$100 expense). Dashboard: income $250, expenses $100, profit $150, both listed in Recent Transactions. Reports/August 2026: income $250, expenses $100, profit +$150, Consulting $250 income, Marketing $100 expense.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Chart axis labels lack precision (rounded to $0k)\", \"actual\": \"Dashboard \\\"Income vs Expenses\\\" chart plots Aug 2026 income $250 and expenses $100, but all five Y-axis tick labels read \\\"$0k\\\", so non-zero values below $500 are indistinguishable from zero.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
